      48.02,
      550.55,
      286.75,
      677.99
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired : The Allotment in total extent of about 0.0031 Hectare of land in Block No. 04 and Sheet No. 1 in Cadastral Map No. 520042 dated 27.02.2025 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Colombo District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 603C, Munamale-Yakahaluwa in the Village of Kiriwaththuduwa in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama in Colombo District in the Western Province.",
